<title>NETHERLANDS: ING Barings rates Schuttersveld as a buy.</title>
<headline>ING Barings rates Schuttersveld as a buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Aug 23 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Schuttersveld   Plastics	65.80   ING Barings</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy. H1 net disappoints but encouraging underlying performance, not reflected in price. Pick-up in German economic growth to help. Target Dfl 75 gives outperformance of 11 pct.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	5.76    (n/a)    11.4	1.70</p>
<p>    1996 (estimate)    6.50    6.97     10.1	2.00</p>
<p>    1997 (estimate)    7.45    7.82	8.8	2.30</p>
<p>    1998 (estimate)    8.45    8.85	7.8	2.60</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
